<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-021" chapter-id="c-nanshi-021-wangyu" source-id="s-nanshi-021-wangyu-ws1752646">
  <p id="c-nanshi-021-wangyu:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-021-wangyu:p001:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAAA">瑒</persName>弟<persName id="c-nanshi-021-wangyu:p001:m0002" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAAB">瑜</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-021-wangyu:p001:m0004" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAAB">子珪</persName>，亦知名。美容儀。年三十，官至侍中。永定元年使齊，以陳郡<persName id="c-nanshi-021-wangyu:p001:m0034" ref="6qj_3sw_6fo">袁憲</persName>爲副。齊以<persName id="c-nanshi-021-wangyu:p001:m0041" ref="hu7_m9r_hro">王琳</persName>故，囚之。齊文宣毎行，載死囚以從，齊人呼曰供禦囚。毎佗怒，則召殺之。<persName id="c-nanshi-021-wangyu:p001:m0077" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAAABAAB">瑜</persName>及<persName id="c-nanshi-021-wangyu:p001:m0079" ref="6qj_3sw_6fo">憲</persName>並危殆者數矣，齊僕射<persName id="c-nanshi-021-wangyu:p001:m0090" ref="fum_370_iq6_AAAED">楊遵彥</persName>毎救護之。天嘉二年還朝，復爲侍中。卒，諡曰貞子。</p>
</text>
